    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d134">

                <pb facs="0232" n="130" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg130"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A5/513: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bingham</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-10-25T11:00:00+00:00">October 25,
                            1935—11 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 25—8 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>536. Department’s 313, October 24, 7 p.m. Following is text of first paragraphs
                    of invitation dated October 24:</p>
                <p>[Here follows text printed in <ref target="frus:frus1931-41v01/pg_278">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, volume I,
                        page 278</ref>.]</p>
                <p>I propose to answer this invitation by a formal note based on the first paragraph
                    of Department’s 313, October 24, 7 p.m. and failing <pb facs="0233" n="131"
                        xml:id="pg131"/> immediate instructions to the contrary, in delivering this
                    written reply I assume it is the Department’s purpose that I convey orally the
                    substance of the Department’s 315, October 24, 9 p.m.</p>
                <p>The British précis of conversation referred to in my 522, October 17, 3 p.m. not
                    yet received.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bingham</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
